{"seq":1,"slug":"care-institution-operations","title":"养老机构运营","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/operations-and-service/care-institution-operations","wordCount":1270,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"养老机构运营\">养老机构运营</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>我开头说过那家理念先进却两年关门的机构。复盘它的失败，问题不在护理质量，而在一张算不平的账：入住率长期上不去，可房租、人力的成本却一分不少地照付。那次教训让我把&quot;运营&quot;两个字刻进了脑子——养老首先得活下来，才谈得上做好。</p>\n<p>这一节抓住：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>收入侧</strong>：床位费、护理费、长护险支付、政府补贴。</li>\n<li><strong>成本侧</strong>：人力（最大头）、房租、餐饮、耗材、水电。</li>\n<li><strong>入住率</strong>：机构的生命线，直接决定盈亏。</li>\n<li><strong>护理员配比</strong>：既关乎服务质量，也是最大的成本变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"钱怎么进-怎么出\">钱怎么进、怎么出</h3><p>养老机构的账本两边，一边是收入，一边是成本。我先用一张表把它摆清楚：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>收入侧</th>\n<th>成本侧</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>床位费</td>\n<td>人力（护理员、护士、行政）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>护理费（按等级）</td>\n<td>房租/物业</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长护险支付</td>\n<td>餐饮成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>政府运营补贴</td>\n<td>耗材（尿垫、药品）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增值服务</td>\n<td>水电、维修</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这里最该记住的一件事：<strong>人力是养老机构最大的成本</strong>，通常能占到总成本的一半以上。这也意味着，护理员配多配少，几乎直接决定一家机构是赚是亏。</p>\n<h3 id=\"入住率-为什么是生命线\">入住率：为什么是生命线</h3><p>养老机构的成本里有很大一块是固定的——房租照付、骨干员工工资照发，不管住进来几个老人。这种&quot;固定成本高&quot;的特点，使得入住率成了决定生死的关键。我们可以用一个简化的保本思路来理解。</p>\n<p>设机构每月固定成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，每张床每月净收益（收入减去这张床带来的变动成本）为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>，那么保本所需的入住床位数为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>保本</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{保本}} = \\frac{C_f}{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">保本</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>举个例子：某机构每月固定成本 30 万元，每张床每月净收益 2500 元，那么：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>保本</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>300000</mn><mn>2500</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mtext> 张</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{保本}} = \\frac{300000}{2500} = 120 \\ \\text{张}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">保本</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2500</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">300000</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">张</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>也就是说，至少要住满 120 位老人才能不亏。如果机构总床位是 150 张，那么保本入住率就是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>120</mn><mn>150</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{120}{150} \\times 100\\% = 80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">150</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">120</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>80% 这个数字很说明问题——养老机构的安全垫很薄，入住率掉到七成就可能亏损。这就是为什么招商、口碑、转介对机构如此性命攸关。</p>\n<h3 id=\"护理员配比-质量与成本的拔河\">护理员配比：质量与成本的拔河</h3><p>护理员配多了，服务好但成本高、可能亏；配少了，成本低但照护跟不上、出事故、砸口碑。所以配比是一场质量和成本的拔河。行业通常按失能等级来配，重度失能老人需要的人手远多于自理老人：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[入住老人结构] --&gt; B{失能等级分布}&#10;    B --&gt;|自理多| C[配比可低:成本低]&#10;    B --&gt;|重度多| D[配比需高:成本高/收费也高]&#10;    C --&gt; E[测算总人力需求]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[排班:覆盖24小时含夜班]\">flowchart TD\n    A[入住老人结构] --&gt; B{失能等级分布}\n    B --&gt;|自理多| C[配比可低:成本低]\n    B --&gt;|重度多| D[配比需高:成本高/收费也高]\n    C --&gt; E[测算总人力需求]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[排班:覆盖24小时含夜班]</pre><p>一个常见思路是给不同等级设&quot;照护当量&quot;：比如自理老人记 0.3、中度记 0.6、重度记 1.0，把全院老人折算成总当量，再除以单个护理员能承担的当量，就得出所需护理员数。这样既保证了重度老人的照护，又不会因一刀切配比而浪费人力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"智慧化怎么帮运营省钱\">智慧化怎么帮运营省钱</h3><p>这正是&quot;智慧养老&quot;对运营的价值所在：远程监测让一个护理员能照看更多床位、自动记录省下护理员写表格的时间、预警系统减少事故和纠纷成本。技术投入是要花钱的，但如果它能让同样的人力服务更多老人、降低事故率，长期看是在帮机构把那张薄薄的盈利账算平。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>某机构固定成本每月 24 万元，每床每月净收益 2000 元，求保本床位数；若总床位 150 张，保本入住率是多少？</li>\n<li>为什么说&quot;人力是养老机构最大的成本&quot;？这对引入智慧化设备的决策有什么启示？</li>\n<li>用&quot;照护当量&quot;思路：一院有自理老人 40 人（0.3）、中度 30 人（0.6）、重度 20 人（1.0），总当量是多少？</li>\n<li>入住率从 85% 跌到 70% 对一家机构意味着什么？结合保本逻辑分析。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>找一份养老机构运营的财务模型或案例，对照本节的收入/成本结构看真实数字。</li>\n<li>了解你所在地区的养老机构运营补贴政策，它直接影响收入侧的测算。</li>\n<li>阅读智慧养老降本增效的实践报道，看技术到底在哪些环节省了钱。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>这一节我们用一本&quot;账&quot;看懂了养老机构怎么活下来：收入与成本两侧、入住率这条生命线、护理员配比的拔河，以及智慧化如何帮着省钱。但能赚钱不等于办得好，机构还得过质量和监管这一关。最后一节，我们就讲服务质量与标准——把&quot;活下来&quot;和&quot;做得好&quot;接上。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"养老机构运营","id":"养老机构运营"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"钱怎么进、怎么出","id":"钱怎么进-怎么出"},{"level":3,"text":"入住率：为什么是生命线","id":"入住率-为什么是生命线"},{"level":3,"text":"护理员配比：质量与成本的拔河","id":"护理员配比-质量与成本的拔河"},{"level":3,"text":"智慧化怎么帮运营省钱","id":"智慧化怎么帮运营省钱"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"紧急响应与安全","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/smart-care-technology/emergency-response-and-safety"},"next":{"title":"服务质量与标准","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/operations-and-service/service-quality-and-standards"}}